From 243457c3960b772551dc9d38d629deb540ea07b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:39:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Pages: buttons show Working / Done; Wallguard state colours
 (102.8 line)

- A shared helper in reaper_util.js: a button that starts a request shows Working... until the
  router answers, then Done or Failed for a moment; a second click meanwhile is ignored; a 30 s
  guard ends a request that never answers. Wired on 18 pages; the Devices dialog stays, its button
  working, until the router answers.
- Wallguard: the state and verdict colours reach their table cells (a table rule outranked the
  bare classes, so ok was never green and failed / missing never amber).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
